historytracers (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split into four binary packages:
    - historytracers (main): binary, service, config (depends on -www)
    - historytracers-www: static web content from www/ (excluding images/),
      installable alone for use with Apache/IIS
    - historytracers-images: all image files from www/images/
    - historytracers-devel: complete source tree except www/

